    "name": "Auditory 1/f Scaling \u2014 Biophilic Soundscape Statistics",
    "structural_pattern": "Auditory scene statistics with 1/f power spectral density (PSD) match the tuning of the human auditory system, minimizing metabolic cost of processing. Deviations from 1/f (white noise, tonal noise) increase prediction error and fatigue.",
    "higher_order_principle": "Spectral Match. The auditory system evolved in environments with 1/f statistics (wind, water, rain). Matching these statistics induces 'processing fluency' and effortless attention (Kaplan's soft fascination).",
